# Plugins SwiftBar should not load. Same shape as .gitignore: one pattern per
# line, `#` comments, `*` and `**/` globs, matched against the filename and the
# path relative to this directory.
#
# claude-usage.30s.sh is superseded by UsageBar (~/code/projects/usagebar), a
# native menu bar app that reads the same codexbar cache and draws the same
# panel in a real popover instead of a PNG stuffed into a menu row. The plugin
# still works; it is kept here because it is the fallback if UsageBar is ever
# uninstalled, and because it is the reference for the drawing the app ported.
# Delete the line below to bring it back.
claude-usage.30s.sh

# yabai_layers.30s.sh is superseded by LayerBar (~/code/projects/layerbar), a
# native menu bar app that reads yabai over its socket directly and refreshes
# on the same yabai-signal pokes (now `notifyutil -p
# com.mackhaymond.layerbar.refresh` -- see yabairc / yabai_skhd_mode.sh)
# instead of swiftbar:// URL opens. The plugin still works and is kept as the
# fallback if LayerBar is ever uninstalled (restore the swiftbar:// pokes too).
# Delete the line below to bring it back.
yabai_layers.30s.sh
